<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <script>(function(){var t=localStorage.getItem('theme')||'light';document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);})();</script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <title>Acción de Entrega</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background: var(--color-bg);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-4);
        }

        .action-card {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 480px;
            background: var(--color-surface);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .action-header {
            background: var(--color-primary);
            padding: var(--space-6);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: var(--space-3);
        }

        .action-header .material-symbols-outlined {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: white;
        }

        .action-header-text h1 {
            color: white;
            font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
            margin: 0;
        }

        .action-header-text p {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
            font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
            margin-top: var(--space-1);
        }

        .action-body {
            padding: var(--space-6);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: var(--space-4);
        }

        .action-tracking {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
            color: var(--color-text-secondary);
            padding: var(--space-3);
            background: var(--color-bg);
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            border: 1.5px solid var(--color-border);
        }

        .action-tracking strong {
            color: var(--color-primary);
            font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
            display: block;
            margin-top: var(--space-1);
        }

        .action-btn {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: var(--space-4);
            padding: var(--space-5);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            border: 2px solid transparent;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all var(--transition);
            width: 100%;
        }

        .action-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .action-btn-icon {
            width: 52px;
            height: 52px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .action-btn-icon .material-symbols-outlined {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
        }

        .action-btn-text h3 {
            font-size: var(--font-size-base);
            margin: 0 0 var(--space-1);
        }

        .action-btn-text p {
            font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
            margin: 0;
        }

        .action-btn.success {
            background: var(--color-success-bg);
            border-color: var(--color-success);
        }

        .action-btn.success .action-btn-icon {
            background: var(--color-success);
        }

        .action-btn.success .action-btn-icon .material-symbols-outlined {
            color: white;
        }

        .action-btn.success h3 { color: var(--color-success); }
        .action-btn.success p  { color: var(--color-success); opacity: 0.8; }

        .action-btn.danger {
            background: var(--color-danger-bg);
            border-color: var(--color-danger);
        }

        .action-btn.danger .action-btn-icon {
            background: var(--color-danger);
        }

        .action-btn.danger .action-btn-icon .material-symbols-outlined {
            color: white;
        }

        .action-btn.danger h3 { color: var(--color-danger); }
        .action-btn.danger p  { color: var(--color-danger); opacity: 0.8; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="action-card">
    <div class="action-header">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">qr_code_scanner</span>
        <div class="action-header-text">
            <h1>Acción de entrega</h1>
            <p>¿Qué pasó con este envío?</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="action-body">
        <div class="action-tracking">
            Envío escaneado
            <strong><%= trackingCode %></strong>
        </div>

        <a href="/delivery/evidence/<%= trackingCode %>/pod" class="action-btn success">
            <div class="action-btn-icon">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">check_circle</span>
            </div>
            <div class="action-btn-text">
                <h3>Entrega exitosa</h3>
                <p>El destinatario recibió el paquete</p>
            </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/delivery/failed/<%= trackingCode %>" class="action-btn danger">
            <div class="action-btn-icon">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">cancel</span>
            </div>
            <div class="action-btn-text">
                <h3>Intento fallido</h3>
                <p>No se pudo completar la entrega</p>
            </div>
        </a>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>